  "title": "Farm leasing is only going to continue to become more prevalent as la...",
  "description": "Farm leasing is only going to continue to become more prevalent as large agribusinesses and private investment funds scoop up more of the land. This system promotes annual agriculture which, in our industrial system, is extractive and propped up by fossil fuels. Agriculture is a huge driver of climate change and the biodiversity crisis and it’s vital we move to a perennial based system with more tree crops like chestnuts and hazelnuts as staples. We can help farmers transition as they wait for the new crops to establish",
